Source: alx-doctor
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Algothix OS Maintainers <maintainers@algothix.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://algothix.com

Package: alx-doctor
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, procps
Description: System health and performance diagnostics for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 Inspects RAM usage, ALX hardware profile, zram and swap state, earlyoom,
 disk type and free space, I/O scheduler udev rules, per-user slice limits,
 failed systemd units, top memory users, and heavy background services.
 Outputs an OK/WARN/FAIL table with suggested fixes or machine-readable JSON.
